Agent icons

- Antigravity: the full-color icon from https://antigravity.google/press/ (resampled to 144 px).
- Claude Code: Claude Spark - Clay from https://www.anthropic.com/press-kit .
- Codex: OpenAI Blossom, black and white PNGs from the OpenAI brand archive.
  https://openai.com/brand/ and https://cdn.openai.com/brand/openai-logos.zip
- Cursor: CUBE_2D_LIGHT.svg and CUBE_2D_DARK.svg from https://cursor.com/brand .
- fx: the site icon from https://fx.sh/favicon.png .
- Hermes Agent: the unplated 48 px light and dark app icons from
  https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/tree/95a1d228c54e3a088892b38503c5c7796a98455e/apps/desktop/assets/appx
  (MIT, LICENSE-Hermes-Agent).
- Oh My Pi: https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi/blob/57771ae562b9345e0579bceb2d68d585e3e6927e/assets/icon.svg
  (MIT, LICENSE-Oh-My-Pi).
- OpenCode: the light and dark square logos from https://opencode.ai/brand .
- Pi: the badge from https://pi.dev/press-kit . Its two source CSS fills are
  written as separate assets so the native menu can select the appearance.
- Grok: monochrome mark from LobeHub icons, by way of Better Icons for Herdr.
  https://github.com/lobehub/lobe-icons/tree/master/packages/static-svg/icons
  (MIT, LICENSE). Loci selects a neutral foreground for the current appearance.

Brand marks identify their products and remain their owners' trademarks.
